{"command": "create", "path": "/root/redact.py", "file_text": """"Blind-review redaction following academic-pdf-redaction/SKILL.md.

Discovers identity literals per-document from page 1 title block, page 1
footnotes/correspondence, document metadata, and repeated header/footer bands.
